# Secrets - NEVER commit these
# NOTE: google-services.json is intentionally NOT ignored — it's the Android
# FCM *client* config (package-restricted, not a secret) and MUST be tracked
# so EAS Build includes it in the upload. EAS excludes gitignored paths even
# when committed, which silently breaks the build (missing google-services.json).
# The sensitive Firebase *service account* key stays ignored below.
GoogleService-Info.plist
# NOTE: src/config/firebase.ts holds only the PUBLIC web SDK config (apiKey is
# a project identifier, not a secret — guarded by Firestore rules), so it IS
# tracked, like the old Supabase anon key in app.json. Service-account keys
# (the real secret) are ignored below and live outside the repo.

# EAS local credentials (keystore is *.jks above; this holds its passwords)
credentials.json

